  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkning av SRHR vid folkh&#xe4;lsomyndigheter i Afrika</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening SRHR at African public health institutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A program to strengthen institutional public health capacity on sexual and reproductive health and rights (SRHR) in Southern Africa. The Public Health Agency of Sweden leads the implementation of the program, with the strategic advice and engagement from Africa Centres for Disease Control and Prevention (Africa CDC). The programme aims to strengthen institutional frameworks, technical capacities, human resources and communication by cooperation with and between ministries of health, national agencies, academia, and civil society organizations in Sub-Saharan Africa and Sweden.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A capacity development program to strengthen sexual and reproductive health and rights (SRHR) at national public health institutions in Botswana, Mozambique and Zambia and elsewhere in Sub-Saharan Africa, as well as at the Africa Centres for Disease Control and Prevention. The Public Health Agency of Sweden will implement the program.  It will strengthen of institutional frameworks, technical capacities and human resources through cooperation with ministries of health, national agencies, academia, and civil society organizations in Africa and Sweden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett kapacitetsutvecklingsprogram f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka sexuell och reproduktiv h&#xe4;lsa och r&#xe4;ttigheter (SRHR) i nationella folkh&#xe4;lsoinstitutioner i Botswana, Mo&#xe7;ambique och Zambia samt &#xf6;vrig Afrika s&#xf6;der om Sahara samt i Africa Centers for Disease Control and Prevention. Folkh&#xe4;lsomyndigheten kommer att genomf&#xf6;ra programmet. Det kommer att st&#xe4;rka institutionella ramar, teknisk kapacitet och m&#xe4;nskliga resurser genom samarbete med h&#xe4;lsoministerier, nationella myndigheter, akademin och civilsamh&#xe4;llets organisationer i Afrika och Sverige.</narrative>
  </description>
